 "strings": {
  "You already had your turn.": "",
  "It's my turn this time.": "",
  "Kuroiwa killed Matsugane-san.": "",
  "This guy killed Matsugane-san.": "",
  "And, well, it's about time\nI pay him back for what he did.": "",
  "I've had to hold it\nin a while now...": "",
  "Heh. Touching words, Yagami-san.": "",
  "How sweet...": "",
  "But now is the time for action.": "",
  "Come at me, then.": "",
  "And don't worry.\nI won't arrest you for obstruction on this.": "",
  "Don't worry. I won't arrest you\non obstruction charges or anything.": "",
  "Don't talk to me about arrests.": "",
  "Don't give me that shit.": "",
  "You're not even a cop.": "",
  "You're hardly even a cop.": "",
  "You're a goddamn assassin!": "",
  "Just an assassin with a badge!": "",
  "I'm done with this.": "",
  "Just stop it!": "",
  "I'm gonna fucking kill you.": "",
  "I'll fucking kill you.": "",
  "Calm down.": "",
  "How would you even cover this up?": "",
  "How would you cover this up?": "",
  "There are limits to how much\nprotection I can offer you.": "",
  "Even my protections have limits.": "",
  "You have no reason to be here.": "",
  "You two have no reason to be here.　": "",
  "Kaito-san. Let's go.": "",
  "Let's go, Kaito-san.　": "",
  "Get back!\nEveryone, step away, now!": "",
  "Get back! All of you,\nget back! Now!": "",
  "Shut your trap, asshole!\nWhat station you from!?": "",
  "Shut up, asshole!\nWhat station you from!?": "",
  "Think you're tough shit, huh!?\nWhat's going on in there!?": "",
  "You got no right to keep us\nout! What's happening!?": "",
  "What are they doing...?": "",
  "What are they doing? ": "",
  "Those guys are Matsugane Family,\naren't they?": "",
  "They're Matsugane Family,\naren't they?": "",
  "Heh, damn right. They're probably\nworried about you or somethin'.": "",
  "They're probably worried about you.": "",
  "Afraid the AD-9 boys'd come\ntry to erase you, y'know?": "",
  "They wouldn't appreciate the AD-9\ngoons taking you out of commission. ": "",
  "Hey! There he is.": "",
  "Hey! He's in there!": "",
  "C'mon. We're outta here.": "",
  "All right. Fall back, boys.": "",
  "Hoshino-kun?": "",
  "Yagami-san. When I heard you were\nhere with Morita and Kuroiwa...": "",
  "I heard you took off to have\nit out with the chief and Kuroiwa...": "",
  "So I...": "",
  "I get it. You're the one who called\nHigashi over, aren't you?": "",
  "So you're the one who called\nin Higashi and the others?": "",
  "That's right.": "",
  "I did.": "",
  "If I hadn't... Who knows what dirty\ntricks they would've used?": "",
  "Our enemies aren't above\nusing the dirtiest tricks in the book.": "",
  "I couldn't take that risk.": "",
  "Unlike you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I appreciate that, Hoshino.": "",
  "You need to worry less, man.": "",
  "And... I'm really sorry for what\nhappened in Kido's office!": "",
  "I'm really sorry about\nhow I acted in front of Kido!": "",
  "I was out of line.": "",
  "I kinda lost it.　": "",
  "You deserve trust... And I didn't give it.": "",
  "I guess I've got a lot to learn...": "",
  "Yagami-san. I messed up.": "",
  "I'm... really sorry.": "",
  "What I did was unacceptable.\nThreatening a witness is just...": "",
  "All that talk about threatening\na witness into testifying...": "",
  "It's not how I wanna go about\nwinning this case, Yagami-san.": "",
  "That's not acceptable in any\nsituation, even to win.": "",
  "Got one thing to say, Hoshino.": "",
  "You heard this one, Hoshino-kun?": "",
  "Iron burns temptation,\nwhile the just are often tested by fire.": "",
  "\"Fire burns temptation,\niron burns the just.\"": "",
  "...Huh?": "",
  "Wait! Get back here!": "",
  "Tak? What's goin' on!?": "",
  "Huh? What is it?": "",
  "Hey... What the hell was that?": "",
  "Yo, who was that?": "",
  "He's got a black raincoat...": "",
  "A black raincoat...": "",
  "Who are you?": "",
  "Guess it's almost time.": "",
  "It's almost time.": "",
  "Captain Hamura?": "",
  "The hell're you doin' here?": "",
  "Sorry sight, wasn't it?": "",
  "It was a sorry sight.": "",
  "Matsugane's funeral.": "",
  "The boss's funeral.": "",
  "They had to go and use HQ's gigantic hall. Made it\nlook like barely anyone even bothered to show up.": "",
  "Having it in HQ's huge hall\nonly made it look sadder.": "",
  "Wish I could've gone, and lit some incense...\nBut if I did, Kuroiwa would've taken me out.": "",
  "I wish I could've left some incense...\nBut Kuroiwa would've found me for sure.": "",
  "Yeah?\nThen what are you doing here?": "",
  "Then why show up here?": "",
  "Tak. You found Shono's lab, right?\nGood job.": "",
  "You found Shono's\nsecret lab, right Tak?": "",
  "Those bastards never wanted\nto tell me where it was.": "",
  "They never even\nlet me in on that.": "",
  "Didn't think you could do it.": "",
  "I underestimated you.": "",
  "Maybe. But Ichinose's covering\nthe whole damn thing up.": "",
  "But it was for nothing.\nIchinose blocked the search.": "",
  "Heh. Outta options, huh?\nI thought giving up wasn't your style.": "",
  "All out of options, then?\nI thought you never gave up?": "",
  "Here's the deal.": "",
  "There's something...": "",
  "I got something for you.": "",
  "...I want you to have.": "",
  "Gotta settle accounts.": "",
  "This is my way of atoning. ": "",
  "What accounts?": "",
  "Atoning?": "",
  "Never mind. But holding onto this\ndoes nothing for me.": "",
  "It doesn't do me\nmuch good anymore.": "",
  "I wanna help you out here...\nJust this once.": "",
  "In your hands,\nmaybe it'll be useful.": "",
  "For the boss.\nGive him justice.": "",
  "So it's yours.": "",
  "If there was any justice, I'd have gotten shot.\nBut the boss paid the price instead.": "",
  "I let the boss own up for something\nthat should have been my burden to bear.": "",
  "Fucked up yeah?\nNone of this was his fault.": "",
  "But he never did anything wrong.": "",
  "I already lost my chance.\nYou on the other hand still may have one.": "",
  "If I didn't help you now, the boss would\nhaunt me for the rest of my days.": "",
  "This is it.\nYou're the boss's only shot now.": "",
  "You just might be able to beat them.": "",
  "Put an end to this.\nOnce and for all.": "",
  "All I want for the boss...\nis vengeance. ": "",
  "I think you'll like\nwhat you find on here.": "",
  "I've got some data\nyou might like here.": "",
  "This is decisive evidence.\nIt'll nail Ichinose.": "",
  "The only piece of evidence\ntying Ichinose to me.": "",
  "This \"Kuroiwa-san\"...\nis a Kamuro PD detective.": "",
  "Kuroiwa is a detective at\nthe Kamurocho station.": "",
  "But when he's not out on his beat,\nhe works as the Mole, an assassin for hire.": "",
  "But off duty, he's suspected of being\nan assassin referred to as \"the Mole.\"": "",
  "In this call, you used Hamura to order\nKuroiwa to murder Shintani-sensei.": "",
  "You ordered Hamura to have\nKuroiwa kill Shintani.": "",
  "You should have\nknown better, Ichinose-san.": "",
  "Pretty careless to discuss that\nover the phone, I'd say.": "",
  "I imagine you must have been pretty panicked\nto use such an insecure method.": "",
  "A man of your status must\nhave been pretty panicked.": "",
  "Audio means nothing.\nForging it is a simple task.": "",
  "Audio data like that is easily forged.": "",
  "You're framing me.": "",
  "A groundless claim.": "",
  "So, you think that's not enough?": "",
  "You're saying it's\nnot enough evidence?": "",
  "Then what if I had a material witness\nwho could attest to its validity?": "",
  "And if I had a witness who\ncould corroborate it?": "",
  "I'd say, bring them.": "",
  "I'd say call them in.": "",
  "Perfect. Just a minute.": "",
  "Then that's what I'll do.": "",
  "Not who you expected?": "",
  "Surprised?": "",
  "Witness.\nWho is speaking in this recording?": "",
  "Witness.\nThis recording is what exactly?": "",
  "I'm one of them.\nThe other is Vice Minister Ichinose here.": "",
  "One voice is mine.\nThe other's is Ichinose.": "",
  "Without a doubt.": "",
  "No doubt about it!": "",
  "Order in the court.": "",
  "Order in the court!": "",
  "Izumida.\nWhere is the Chief Prosecutor?": "",
  "Hey!\nWhere is Chief Prosecutor Morita?": "",
  "Is he aware of this farce?": "",
  "Is he aware of all this!?": "",
  "About that, sir. The chief prosecutor\nwon't be joining us in court today.": "",
  "The chief prosecutor would\nhave jurisdiction over this trial...": "",
  "Or ever again.": "",
  "But we've relieved him.": "",
  "It turns out he's been abetting crimes\nfor some time now. And so...": "",
  "The chief prosecutor is\ngoing to be charged...": "",
  "We're charging him with abuse of power.": "",
  "...With official misconduct.": "",
  "Kido's up next.\nRight after my testimony.": "",
  "Kido will be testifying after me.": "",
  "The doctor sides with\nwhoever he thinks'll win.": "",
  "The doc prefers to be\non the winning team.": "",
  "And look at that.\nGuess he thinks you're on the losing side.": "",
  "And guess what?\nHe's not playing for you anymore.": "",
  "Listen here.": "",
  "Ichinose-san. ": "",
  "You pushed countless people down\non your way to the top.": "",
  "You earned your place\natop a vicious world.": "",
  "Now it's your turn to fall.\n...Ichinose.": "",
  "Have the decency\nto fall with grace.": "",
  "Already goin'!": "",
  "On it!": "",
  "What the hell was that about?\nWhere's he going?": "",
  "Was that some kind of order?\nWhat are you doing?": "",
  "Hoshino-kun.": "",
  "It's all on you now.": "",
  "Take over for me.": "",
  "You've always wanted to\nhandle a case on your own, right?": "",
  "You'll have to sink or swim\nat some point, right?": "",
  "Sorry to spring this on you...\nBut good luck!": "",
  "Sorry it's out of the blue...\nBut today's that day.": "",
  "Please, don't go!": "",
  "Wait, you can't!": "",
  "I know you can do it, Hoshino-kun.": "",
  "I'm trusting you with it, Hoshino-kun.": "",
  "It's time you graduate from\nthe sidekick role, y'know?": "",
  "You can't be a professional\nsidekick forever.": "",
  "Are you ready to proceed?": "",
  "Is something the matter?": "",
  "Um... Uh...": "",
  "Eh!? Uh...": "",
  "The defense is ready... Your honor.": "",
  "Nothing's the matter.\nLet's carry on.": "",
  "Caught this asshole handin'\nout orders over the phone.": "",
  "This fuckin' weasel just\nphoned in his orders.": "",
  "Orders? What did he say?": "",
  "To who?\nWhat order?": "",
  "He told his boys to eliminate the Mole.": "",
  "Eliminate the Mole.": "",
  "They'd eliminate him?": "",
  "Eliminate the Mole!?": "",
  "Wait... They're gonna kill Kuroiwa.": "",
  "They'll kill Kuroiwa then!?": "",
  "Guess in the end he's just a tool\nfor them to, y'know... Dispose of.": "",
  "He's just a tool they can toss\naside when they please.": "",
  "But we're done for if\nwe let that happen.": "",
  "We're screwed if that happens.": "",
  "He's gotta be over in Kamurocho.": "",
  "Kuroiwa's in Kamurocho.": "",
  "C'mon. Sugiura's pullin'\nthe car around now.": "",
  "Let's go!\nSugiura's bringing the car around!": "",
  "Dammit!": "",
  "Yagami's here.": "",
  "Not another step.": "",
  "C'mon! He's over here!": "",
  "Hey! Let's go!": "",
  "These guys don't seem\nlike regular thugs.": "",
  "Not your average street trash,\nI'd say.": "",
  "Guess these are Ministry boys, huh?": "",
  "Are they Health Ministry thugs?": "",
  "If they get in your way,\ndon't hesitate to make 'em pay for it.": "",
  "If they get in the way,\nhit 'em till they move.": "",
  "Now don't stop 'til\nyou get to Theater Square!": "",
  "Let's gun it for Theater Square!": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "That's right.": "ถูกต้องแล้ว",
  "I did.": "ใช่",
  "...Huh?": "...เอ๊ะ?",
  "Huh? What is it?": "หืม? มีอะไรเหรอ?",
  "Who are you?": "คุณเป็นใครกัน?",
  "Without a doubt.": "ไม่ต้องสงสัยเลย",
  "On it!": "จัดให้!",
  "Is something the matter?": "มีอะไรผิดปกติหรือเปล่า?",
  "Dammit!": "แม่ง!"
 }
}
